{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51180","headline":"五言（八首） 七 · 王梵志","name":"五言（八首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大皮里大树，小皮里小木。\n生儿不用多，了事一个足。\n省得分田宅，无人横煎蹙。\n但行平等心，天亦念孤独。\n我身虽孤独，（自「我身虽孤独」以下，张锡厚作另一首。\n）未死先怀虑。\n家有五男儿，哭我无所据。\n哭我我不闻，不哭我亦去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}